# Recorded input for the popover example page (widgets/popover.zig, `Example`), at 800 x 600 in
# the default theme: the trigger "Details" at x 8..83, y 8..42; the open panel at x 8..133,
# y 48..105, on a scrim over the whole window. One line per frame says what it does (format:
# input.Replay). Key 41 is Escape (USB HID).
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 800 600
dt 0.016
pointer 400 300
# 1: hover the trigger
frame
pointer 45 25
# 2: hold it
frame
buttons left
# 3: release over it: open
frame
buttons
# 4: hover the panel
frame
pointer 70 76
# 5: press inside the panel: stays open
frame
buttons left
# 6: release
frame
buttons
# 7: press outside (on the scrim): closed
frame
pointer 400 300
buttons left
# 8: release: nothing under the pointer clicks
frame
buttons
# 9: press the trigger
frame
pointer 45 25
buttons left
# 10: release: open again
frame
buttons
# 11: Escape: closed
frame
press 41
